Regulatory Senior Manager
CropLife International
Brussels, Belgium
Role Overview
CropLife International is seeking an experienced and highly motivated Senior Manager, Regulatory Affairs to support and drive the organization's global regulatory activities. The successful candidate will play a key role in developing industry positions, coordinating regulatory projects and expert teams, engaging with international organizations, and providing scientific and regulatory expertise on issues relevant to crop protection products.
This is an exciting opportunity for a collaborative professional who enjoys working at the intersection of science, regulation, and international policy in a global environment.
